:We'd snack on the roasted skeever we'd freshly caught that day befor{{nst|e, lying|SR=e laying}} under the stars to sleep.
:I'd slowly fade to dream nested in the radiating heat of mammoth fur. Its cold resisting properties keeping me snug.
:What a grand time we would have.</i>
