{{Showhide/Start|The Planemeld|ta1=left}}
''The Planemeld'' is a song from the [[Lore:Interregnum|Interregnum]], composed some time after the [[Lore:Planemeld|Planemeld]] began. It tells of the impending doom all mortals faced at the hands of [[Lore:Molag Bal|Molag Bal]], and was often performed in {{Year|2E 582}}.
:[[Media:ON-audio-The Plane Meld sample (Malukah).ogg|Listen to a sample (Malukah)]]

:<i>Of all the Daedric princes<br>
:There's [[Lore:Molag Bal|one with shocking gall]]<br>
:His goal: The domination and enslavement of us all<br>
:The God of Schemes<br>
:The Prince of Pain<br>
:The Captain of Corruption<br>
:He tills the land of Tamriel<br>
:And sows the seeds of destruction<br>

:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:Our world will disappear<br>

:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:Our doom is drawing near<br>

:[[Online:Dark_Anchor|Chains of darkness grip the land]]<br>
:And draw it ever near<br>
:To his nightmare, Coldharbour<br>
:Where hope bows down to fear<br>
:Tearing souls of innocents<br>
:Into eternal pain<br>
:While his daedric minions<br>
:Sing praises of his name<br>

:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:As Molag Bal commands<br>

:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:The plane meld is nigh<br>
:Our doom is now at hand</i>
{{Showhide/End}}

{{Showhide/Start|The Song of Uncle Sweetshare|ta1=left}}
''The Song of Uncle Sweetshare'' was an old nursery rhyme that ended up inspiring a madman on Solstheim.

:<i>He he! Ha ho!<br>
:To the workshop he will go!<br>
:My Uncle's candy is so sweet!<br>
:It's such a yummy winter's treat!<br>
:When the sugar is warmed by the pale hearth light<br>
:The happiness spreads throughout the night!<br>
:He he! Ha ho!<br>
:To the workshop he will go!<br>
:Uncle Sweetshare is coming near<br>
:To spread his candy and his cheer!<br>
:It's better than trinkets, games or toys<br>
:So say all the little girls and boys!<br>
:He he! Ha ho!<br>
:To the workshop he will go!<br>
:Candy, candy -- he makes so much!<br>
:Uncle Sweetshare has a magic touch!<br>
:So it's back to the workshop in the snow!<br>
:With lovely lanterns all aglow!<br>
:He he! Ha ho! He he he ha ha ho! </i>
{{Showhide/End}}

{{Showhide/Start|Three Hearts As One|ta1=left}}
''Three Hearts As One'' was popular with the [[Lore:Ebonheart Pact|Ebonheart Pact]]'s bards in {{Year|2E 582}}. It tells the tale of the [[Lore:Dunmer|Dunmer]], [[Lore:Argonian|Argonian]] and [[Lore:Nord|Nords']] triumph against the [[Lore:Akaviri|Akaviri]] and the strength of the Alliances' bond.
:[[Media:ON-audio-Three Hearts As One sample (Malukah).ogg|Listen to a sample (Malukah)]]

:<i>We tilled [[Lore:Skyrim|Skyrim]]'s ground despite frozen toil<br>
:We tended the [[Online:kwama|kwama]] beneath [[Lore:Morrowind|Morrowind]] soil<br>
:We hunted the [[Online:wamasu|wamasu]] in [[Lore:Black Marsh|Black Marsh]]'s glades<br>
:We Three hearts had no need for blades

:Then they came from the seas, folded steel in their hands<br>
:They burned down our homes and ravaged our lands<br>
:[[Lore:Akaviri|Akaviri]] brought nothing but bloodshed and lies<br>
:Our families were slain before our eyes

:With Three separate people they shared a cruel joke<br>
:A choice between death or the yoke<br>
:But then our Three people knew what must be done<br>
:To end the oppression, all Three became One

:Forged by war the [[Online:Ebonheart Pact|Ebonheart]] rose<br>
:And drove the Akaviri back to the sea<br>
:When the enemies begged for the mercy they lacked<br>
:Three voices as one shouted "Blood for the Pact"

:Forged by war our story be told<br>
:No shackles can hold us<br>
:Whether moonstone or gold</i>
{{Showhide/End}}
